{"schema_version":"question/v1","id":"q-system-cold-start-001","type":"multi_choice","domain":"ml-system-design","topic":"cold-start","concept_id":"cold-start-strategy","skill":"design","prompt":"处理新用户或新物品 cold start 时，哪些策略可能有效？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"使用内容特征或侧信息"},{"id":"b","text":"探索-利用策略收集反馈"},{"id":"c","text":"使用热门/规则 baseline 作为兜底"},{"id":"d","text":"直接把未知实体映射成任意已知实体"}],"correct_option_ids":["a","b","c"],"explanation":"Cold start 需要在缺少交互数据时保持可用性，并设计探索和快速学习路径。","wiki_refs":[],"status":"enabled","content_sha256":"sha256:87e57efbf34ece9491c649c51407f575fbffbb7344302eb68bcc5fbeb0f475fd"}
